 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_7efd712fdde4ffeafd9c",
   "sourceHash": "7efd712fdde4ffeafd9c9d9fd01ed32c4171d63a1aab5bd0732ccaaa2160c45c",
   "text": "焕发活力的体验！",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f6c93600daa14cb49035",
   "sourceHash": "f6c93600daa14cb49035e6f4e651c0ba81b9332ca81f9abd1ec2c1c8783512f2",
   "text": "“这是最正宗、最好的阿育吠陀治疗场所。他们提供最好的治疗和最优秀的理疗师。院区内的一切都由医生把关。他们以最美味的方式提供最健康的饮食。这里设有出色的瑜伽中心、有机农场、健身房、娱乐室、游泳池、网球场、餐厅和阿育吠陀治疗中心。感觉就像生活在大自然中，同时享有5星级设施。”",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'resort' rendered as 院区 (campus) per clinical register."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4e3990826565021e04b1",
   "sourceHash": "4e3990826565021e04b19345777eac5acc5b7dfe36e65ec4f95637fe5ae93010",
   "text": "Shreya Jain",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": "Person's name kept verbatim.",
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ebf77b0c354a4d9b68e8",
   "sourceHash": "ebf77b0c354a4d9b68e8e7b7d83de3bf2d881e006c9f952c385820abd6be2779",
   "text": "“Kairali 疗愈村环境葱郁、氛围宁静，让人在这里的住院疗养中焕发活力。治疗、有机餐食、健身房、瑜伽和冥想均以阿育吠陀原则为基础。我很喜欢入住根据我的星座和 vastu shastra（建筑风水学）设计的别墅。专业的员工以及治疗前的医生问诊，确保了一段放松且焕发活力的体验。我强烈推荐给所有人”",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'holiday' rendered as 住院疗养 (stay) per clinical register."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d80708aea8b066b8ff51",
   "sourceHash": "d80708aea8b066b8ff512538f4822873dcf21349c054f4ccc36500a39e65ec27",
   "text": "Kajal Kothari",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": "Person's name kept verbatim.",
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0a5ec7f55d695b5ab3e8",
   "sourceHash": "0a5ec7f55d695b5ab3e870cbcfbd30552a03203793580cca0e90bb6ecd044c6f",
   "text": "宾至如归，就像第二个家！",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e0f9f8aba001f61d8159",
   "sourceHash": "e0f9f8aba001f61d8159c555fd40372b4c4f57e0d8dd7c413a86ec11e4caf6f2",
   "text": "“我在 Kairali 的住院经历非常棒——就像第二个家。宁静的氛围和自然环境使这里成为我父亲接受治疗的理想之所。院区的表现超出预期：员工学识丰富，餐食美味，环境宁静。员工们竭尽全力让我们感到舒适。感谢这段焕发活力的体验，也感谢 Kairali 大家庭的善意。谢谢你，Kairali！”",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'resort' rendered as 院区 (campus) per clinical register."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1542261467f9468413bf",
   "sourceHash": "1542261467f9468413bf791a629684704d823c9f7068b565d248f820798518cf",
   "text": "Vibhutee Kohli",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": "Person's name kept verbatim.",
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9978fc45dc3943abf076",
   "sourceHash": "9978fc45dc3943abf0767d0ba3261a9732996d93b044e67e491cc570694bbb4a",
   "text": "改变人生的难忘体验",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6edf9f47a87b45548710",
   "sourceHash": "6edf9f47a87b4554871027085a94759f33c003c16973c132afdee953718f5fd1",
   "text": "“Kairali 是一家出色、正宗的阿育吠陀疗愈机构，带来改变人生的体验。员工乐于配合，服务出色。宁静的氛围和资质优秀的医生让您感到放松、焕发活力。我强烈推荐任何希望过上更健康生活方式的人前来。”",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'healing resort' rendered as 疗愈机构 (healing facility) per clinical register."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_33012dbf742eeb1d8d5a",
   "sourceHash": "33012dbf742eeb1d8d5ae4cdbba630413d9f1433f0492c8b5f7a56a9c7abf88f",
   "text": "Mahender Chaudhary",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": "Person's name kept verbatim.",
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_107ceae84407429464fb",
   "sourceHash": "107ceae84407429464fb8c1cf41f5886dd8f6cb631ea0eb373269983bd262459",
   "text": "我们的专家",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c48d076858a8ea192430",
   "sourceHash": "c48d076858a8ea192430e1e632a1d9d7036295e2b06dd136ffb5cd5ba24841b4",
   "text": "阿育吠陀医生已为3000+名潘查卡玛患者提供治疗",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0af8f04c21b46d2736b5",
   "sourceHash": "0af8f04c21b46d2736b53df9f191e8c4c05e769def40c5c259cdf523763f12af",
   "text": "Dr. Deepu John",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": "Person's name and title kept verbatim.",
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2e6af5910562af06329a",
   "sourceHash": "2e6af5910562af06329a4bbd0934bc6e6b016999f009d0be96f4236120d7e7e8",
   "text": "12+年经验",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_fa19fd11bd95bd8059d7",
   "sourceHash": "fa19fd11bd95bd8059d70dd85b27df27ba7623d1f34791aff8ff63ca9ac28b54",
   "text": "首席医师兼科室主任",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f416952b89c6a3da2d5a",
   "sourceHash": "f416952b89c6a3da2d5a5f6bdb2e5ac0d3403d55ec99004fb671b689c84fc9f5",
   "text": "专长：潘查卡玛与生活方式管理、关节炎、偏头痛、神经肌肉疾病、脊柱疾病、胃肠疾病、肥胖、戒瘾、皮肤病、职业压力相关损伤、呼吸系统疾病等。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_dcaea18f74eb30834eda",
   "sourceHash": "dcaea18f74eb30834eda2617e60a0b87b3be96284cef61b411ec44c82e7bf481",
   "text": "“Kairali 阿育吠陀疗愈村拥有一项独特优势：经验丰富的 Dr. Deepu John，他的诊断和治疗方法精准到位，帮助身体恢复。如今，在接受他建议的潘查卡玛治疗之后，我过上了快乐的生活，工作和个人生活也更加高效",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d9cb3dd41f681b25e75f",
   "sourceHash": "d9cb3dd41f681b25e75f99d032ab12524b43126d71cc2be1c5f15b29a7b68ee1",
   "text": "---Ashish Saini 先生，曾在 Kairali 疗愈村接受潘查卡玛治疗",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_dbc468a14b601d5d9240",
   "sourceHash": "dbc468a14b601d5d9240aeb72b9fcd2f8aed2f4e30932876edf8d16ec313846b",
   "text": "常见问题",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a3d458e1bd1eda066018",
   "sourceHash": "a3d458e1bd1eda066018d8db2dd5537c9e742f02f68401457c01553e77f57403",
   "text": "常见问题解答",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d7dd59ffd5fd7c1d6d11",
   "sourceHash": "d7dd59ffd5fd7c1d6d11215664a0ec50921d064c6deea821481bf823fd8cda36",
   "text": "“外在的健康始于内在”",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d4446c148ee88977d4ea",
   "sourceHash": "d4446c148ee88977d4ea41cc33ba86e7c8527b79fb1aa40022c606558f141f29",
   "text": "哪些疾病可以通过潘查卡玛疗法治疗？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_88015fd3e01696a1a6e9",
   "sourceHash": "88015fd3e01696a1a6e9787e18c98616f51f35065d9c8552f3048dddc33b1ef5",
   "text": "潘查卡玛治疗在多种疾病的治疗和管理中非常有效，例如：关节疾病（类风湿关节炎）、肌肉骨骼疾病（下背痛）、皮肤病（银屑病）、神经系统疾病（瘫痪、偏头痛）、呼吸系统疾病（支气管哮喘）、妇科疾病（白带异常）、精神科疾病、老年病等。它也被广泛用于慢性难治性疾病以及改善生活质量。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c3c7decb5f81892532eb",
   "sourceHash": "c3c7decb5f81892532eb77958c5f175949bdd99365de5cdc6b8e8b08ee0a9eb6",
   "text": "哪些人应该接受潘查卡玛？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
}
